# longitudinal-analysis

cff-version: "1.2.0"
title: "longitudinal-analysis: reproducible longitudinal / panel-data analysis pipeline"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
date-created: 2026-10-15
authors:
  - family-names: "Shi"
    given-names: "Jiaming"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
repository-code: "https://github.com/JiamingShi-JsPhys/agent-skills"
description: "Reproducible multi-step analysis for longitudinal / repeated-measures data: descriptive stats, manipulation check, LMM, lagged mediation, and sensitivity analyses with a deterministic audit log. R (lme4 / lavaan) is invoked for the statistical steps; pure-Python steps degrade gracefully when R is absent."
keywords:
  - longitudinal
  - mixed-models
  - mediation
  - sensitivity
  - reproducible-research
